#: ksecretd/knewwalletdialog.cpp:176
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"No suitable GPG encryption keys were found. To create one, choose one of the "
"following options:<list><item>Install Kleopatra and use it to create a new "
"key. See these <link url='https://docs.kde.org/stable_kf6/en/kleopatra/"
"kleopatra/functions-newkey.html'>instructions</link>.</item><item>Open a "
"terminal and enter <command>gpg --full-gen-key</command>.</item><item>Go "
"back and use Blowfish encryption instead, which only requires a password.</"
"item></list>"
msgstr ""
"Geen geskikte GPG-enkripsiesleutels is gevind nie. Kies een van die volgende "
"opsies om een te skep:<list><item>Installeer Kleopatra en gebruik dit om 'n "
"nuwe sleutel te skep. Sien hierdie <link url='https://docs.kde.org/"
"stable_kf6/en/kleopatra/kleopatra/functions-newkey.html'>instruksies</link>."
"</item><item>Maak 'n terminaal oop en voer <command>gpg --full-gen-key</"
"command> in.</item><item>Gaan terug en gebruik eerder Blowfish-enkripsie, "
"wat slegs 'n wagwoord vereis.</item></list>"

